<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 6-mth coupon T-bills April 2.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 6-mth coupon T-bills April 2.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer a six-month floater coupon T-bill issue with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance next Wednesday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The coupon equals the central bank's main interest rate, now set at 18 percent monthly or 216 percent annually.</p>
<p> Issue number		  BG3023997029</p>
<p> Type			    floater coupon</p>
<p> Term			    six months</p>
<p> Auction date		  April 2</p>
<p> Issue date		    April 2</p>
<p> Maturity date		 October 1</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
